er":"essential","price_band":"~$60-160/pp","timing":"year-round; Salt Pier ship-dependent","draw_rank":3,"hook":"a boat across to the uninhabited islet''s untouched reef, then the pillar-ecosystems of Salt Pier — the two best boat/tide-gated dives","si":"diveglobal","blurb":"a boat across to the uninhabited islet''s untouched reef, then the pillar-ecosystems of Salt Pier — the two best boat/tide-gated dives","when":"year-round; Salt Pier ship-dependent","commission":"dive-op + OTA"},{"name":"Klein Bonaire - the uninhabited islet","si_tag":"tropical","status":"live","tier":"essential","price_band":"~$25-60 boat","timing":"Dec-Apr","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"a boat-only islet of white sand and turtle nesting, no development — the tropical-beach counterpoint to the dive day","si":"tropical","blurb":"a boat-only islet of white sand and turtle nesting, no development — the tropical-beach counterpoint to the dive day","when":"Dec-Apr","commission":"operator/affiliate"},{"name":"A quiet dive-couple week","si_tag":"romance","status":"live","tier":"premier","price_band":"~$200-700+/night","timing":"Dec-Apr","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Bonaire is unhurried and unpretentious — shared dives, a Harbour Village or dive-resort base, sunset over the water off Kralendijk","si":"romance","blurb":"Bonaire is unhurried and unpretentious — shared dives, a Harbour Village or dive-resort base, sunset over the water off Kralendijk","when":"Dec-Apr","commission":"consortia/host"},{"name":"Lac Bay flatwater windsurfing","si_tag":"ocean","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~$40-150/pp","timing":"year-round; windiest May-Jul","draw_rank":1,"hook":"a trade-wind-fed, shallow, protected bay — the Caribbean''s flatwater windsurf mecca, beginner-friendly and world-class, in a RAMSAR wetland","si":"ocean","blurb":"a trade-wind-fed, shallow, protected bay — the Caribbean''s flatwater windsurf mecca, beginner-friendly and world-class, in a RAMSAR wetland","when":"year-round; windiest May-Jul","commission":"operator/affiliate 10-15%"},{"name":"Washington Slagbaai National Park","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~$25-60 + $40 nature fee","timing":"Dec-Apr","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the rugged northwest — a 4,286-ha park, 4×4 tracks, cliffs, blowholes, salt pans and inland flamingo lakes","si":"adventure","blurb":"the rugged northwest — a 4,286-ha park, 4×4 tracks, cliffs, blowholes, salt pans and inland flamingo lakes","when":"Dec-Apr","commission":"operator/affiliate"},{"name":"Flamingos + the sea-turtle nesting shores","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~$25-70/pp","timing":"year-round; turtles seasonal","draw_rank":1,"hook":"RAMSAR wetlands with resident flamingos, and beaches that nest all four Caribbean sea-turtle species — a genuine wildlife layer beside the reef","si":"adventure","blurb":"RAMSAR wetlands with resident flamingos, and beaches that nest all four Caribbean sea-turtle species — a genuine wildlife layer beside the reef","when":"year-round; turtles seasonal","commission":"operator/affiliate"}],"faq":[{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in Bonaire?","a":"Dive discipline, not danger. Because Bonaire is 24/7 drive-up shore diving, hold the no-fly 18-24h window and manage repetitive profiles. The on-island hyperbaric chamber next to the Kralendijk hospital is 24-hour and operational (2026).","source":"o2bonaire.com","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Do I have to pay the Bonaire nature fee and what does it cost?","a":"Yes - a mandatory US$40 STINAPA nature tag for all water activities (2026); it funds no-touch/no-anchor enforcement, fish surveys and reef restoration, and also covers Washington Slagbaai NP. Buy it online before you dive.","source":"bonaire.com","si_tag":"diveglobal"},{"q":"When is the best time to dive Bonaire?","a":"Year-round, but December-April is peak (cooler water, best visibility) and April-August brings the calmest seas and superb viz - Bonaire is south of the hurricane belt so there''s no real storm season.","source":"habitatbonaire.com","si_tag":"diveglobal"},{"q":"Which Bonaire dive sites should I not miss?","a":"The Hilma Hooker wreck (30m), 1000 Steps (shallow, snorkel-friendly), Salt Pier (pillar ecosystems - only when no ship is in port) and a Klein Bonaire boat day; most of the ~89 sites are self-guided drive-and-dive off the yellow stones.","source":"scubatravel.co.uk","si_tag":"diveglobal"},{"q":"Is Bonaire a liveaboard destination?","a":"No - Bonaire is the world''s shore/drive-and-dive capital (unlimited-shore packages, drive-thru tank pickup), not a liveaboard base. Book it as a resort-and-shore dive trip, not a Dive Liveaboards sailing.","source":"zubludiving.com","si_tag":"diveglobal"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Bonaire Travel Guide: The Shore-Diving Capital, Marine Park & Nature Fee","meta_description":"Plan Bonaire - the shore-diving capital of the world: ~89 marked marine-park sites you drive up and walk into, the Hilma Hooker wreck, the $40 STINAPA nature fee, an on-island recompression chamber, flamingos and Lac Bay windsurf.","slug":"bonaire","primary_keyword":"Bonaire shore diving","long_tail":["Bonaire shore diving guide 2026","Bonaire National Marine Park dive sites","Hilma Hooker wreck dive","Bonaire STINAPA nature fee","Klein Bonaire boat dive","Lac Bay windsurfing"],"search_language":"nl","local_keywords":["Boneiru","Marine Park Boneiru","Hilma Hooker","STINAPA nature fee","Klein Bonaire","Lac Bay windsurf","Washington Slagbaai"],"hreflang":["en","nl"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","content_freshness":"2026-07-30"},"booking":{"bin":"freely_bookable","level":"L1","codes":[],"consent_flow":f